{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Binomial_Theorem)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Binomial Theorem)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the smallest integer larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/e/94ee37a756d8d72639ebe26606b287a23699ea18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2})^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d190fdeb5659da1f4ba9006d9f8d4a789df93bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 972 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 971 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 970 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 969 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 968$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 1 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6538b862076d57bd188d65889b32546af72fc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2})^6=(5+2\\sqrt{6})^3=(5+2\\sqrt{6})(49+20\\sqrt{6})=(485+198\\sqrt{6})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"540\" height=\"21\" /> Then, find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0af834b481b16223a0f04fa9a05f4f8a581e0182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea11355d651e7b32e099c0b8c50ef65416f0b8e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.449$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. Finally, multiply and add to find that the smallest integer higher is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b07feef4e1e4ca964649ab472e1153acd634169b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf{(C) } 970}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Binomial_Theorem.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Binomial_Theorem)\">Solution 2 (Binomial Theorem)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Binomial Theorem)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de9ecdd8039e68daff3c382ce9633d38274796a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{2})^6 + (\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2})^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"209\" height=\"24\" />. We see that all the irrational terms cancel. Then, using binomial theorem, we evaluate all the rational terms in the first expression to get 485. Then, the sum of the rational parts of the 2nd term will be 485 as well. Then, we get a total of 970 and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba6a943c253b7bf7f1e0d6055106ca0b6b9c75d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{2})^6) &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"21\" />, the greatest integer greater than our original expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b07feef4e1e4ca964649ab472e1153acd634169b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf{(C) } 970}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/z2sdqWV2Tl0\">https://youtu.be/z2sdqWV2Tl0</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Prob